# Normalise line endings so a Windows checkout still produces a working image.
#
# core.autocrlf=true rewrites files to CRLF on checkout. For shell scripts that
# is fatal: the backend image runs entrypoint.sh with dash, which reads the
# trailing \r as part of the argument and dies with "set: Illegal option -"
# before the server ever starts. Anything the Linux containers execute or parse
# is pinned to LF here regardless of the developer's platform.
* text=auto

*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.Dockerfile text eol=lf
Makefile text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
